### Listar servicios
GET http://localhost:3000/services

### Crear un servicio nuevo
POST http://localhost:3000/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barba",
  "duration_minutes": 20,
  "price": 300
}

### Editar el servicio "Barba" (reemplazá el id por el que te devolvió tu POST)
PUT http://localhost:3000/services/f79c996a-f43d-46c7-9c3e-152c9871bc69
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barba prolija",
  "duration_minutes": 25,
  "price": 350
}

### Desactivar ese mismo servicio
PATCH http://localhost:3000/services/f79c996a-f43d-46c7-9c3e-152c9871bc69/toggle-active

### ======================================= AVAILABILITY =======================================

### Crear horario: Lunes a Viernes, 9 a 18
POST http://localhost:3000/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "day_of_week": 5,
  "start_time": "09:00",
  "end_time": "18:00"
}

### Listar horarios
GET http://localhost:3000/availability

### Crear una excepción (feriado)
POST http://localhost:3000/availability/exceptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-25",
  "closed_all_day": true,
  "reason": "Feriado nacional"
}

### Listar excepciones
GET http://localhost:3000/availability/exceptions

### ======================================= CUSTOMERS =======================================

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jorge Fuentes",
  "phone": "+59891234566",
  "notes": "Prefiere turnos por la tarde"
}

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/customers

### Buscar por nombre
GET http://localhost:3000/customers?search=carlos

### Ver detalle (reemplazá el id por el que te devolvió el POST)
GET http://localhost:3000/customers/99f3a315-bd72-4d73-8bd2-9b6a8d5b93d3

### Intentar crear el mismo teléfono de nuevo (debería dar 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro nombre",
  "phone": "+59891234567"
}

### ======================================= APPOINTMENTS =======================================

### Ver horarios disponibles para el "Corte clásico" en una fecha
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments/available-slots?date=2026-08-20&service_id=d70e0e60-22b6-424c-a744-b5b8543f19e8

### Crear una reserva manual (usá un horario que haya aparecido en la lista anterior)
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "99f3a315-bd72-4d73-8bd2-9b6a8d5b93d3",
  "service_id": "d70e0e60-22b6-424c-a744-b5b8543f19e8",
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "created_via": "manual"
}

### Volver a pedir los horarios disponibles: el que acabás de ocupar ya NO debería aparecer
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments/available-slots?date=2026-08-20&service_id=d70e0e60-22b6-424c-a744-b5b8543f19e8

### Intentar crear OTRA reserva en el mismo horario exacto (debe dar 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "9440879f-e889-4c64-8220-cb1c851c1946",
  "service_id": "d70e0e60-22b6-424c-a744-b5b8543f19e8",
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "start_time": "11:00",
  "created_via": "manual"
}

### Ver la agenda del día
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments?date=2026-08-20

### Cambiar el intervalo a 15 minutos 
PATCH http://localhost:3000/appointments/business/settings 
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
  "slot_step_minutes": 15
}

### Volver a 30 
PATCH http://localhost:3000/appointments/business/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slot_step_minutes": 30
}